The '''Rift Gallery''' is a [[Location]] in the [[Rift Dimension]]. It is based on the {{zone|Museum}}.

== Features ==
The '''Rift Gallery''' features multiple attractions. The '''Rift Gallery''' can be accessed using the {{Item|Teleport Pad}} in the {{zone|Wizard Tower (Rift)}} after the player bring the [[Supreme Timecharm]] to {{NPCSprite|Elise (Rift)}}.

=== Securing Timecharms ===
{{Main|Rift Timecharms}}
The player can secure [[Rift Timecharms]] by placing them in their corresponding slots in the '''Rift Gallery'''. This unlocks new [[Zones]] in the Rift and grants {{SkyBlock XP|+100}} from the [[SkyBlock Levels#Tasks|"Timecharms" SkyBlock Levels Task]].

