=== Montezuma Cat Soul ===
{{Main|Montezuma Pet}}
Inside the miniature house in the [[West Village]] section of the '''Rift Gallery''', the player can find the second [[Montezuma Pet|Montezuma Soul Piece]], which is located at {{Coords|0|56|63}}. Finding the soul piece will add an additional {{stat|rt|+15}} to the [[Montezuma Pet|Pet]].

